de-navigation.customization-modal.product-items-list-label",defaultMessage:"Customize {app} navigation",description:'Accessibility label for the product-specific navigation items section in the customization modal. The placeholder {app} is substituted with the application name (e.g., "Jira", "Confluence"). Example: "Customize Jira navigation". Assistive technologies use this label to identify the section.'},appItemsListTitle:{id:"navigation.global-side-navigation.customization-modal.app-items-list-title",defaultMessage:"App shortcuts",description:"The text is shown as a section title in the customization modal for Atlassian app shortcuts. This section displays app shortcuts that users can add to their sidebar."},appItemsListDescription:{id:"navigation.global-side-navigation.customization-modal.app-items-list-description",defaultMessage:"The following Atlassian apps are available for your organization.",description:"The text is shown as descriptive text below the app shortcuts section title in the customization modal. It explains which Atlassian apps are available for users to add as shortcuts in their sidebar."},appItemsListLabel:{id:"navigation.global-side-navigation.customization-modal.app-items-list-label",defaultMessage:"App shortcuts",description:"Accessibility label for the app shortcuts section in the customization modal. Assistive technologies use this label to identify the section containing available Atlassian app shortcuts."},closeButtonText:{id:"navigation.global-side-navigation.customization-modal.close-button-text",defaultMessage:"Cancel",description:"The text is shown on the close button in the customization modal. When clicked, this button closes the modal and discards any unsaved changes to sidebar customization."},closeButtonLabel:{id:"navigation.global-side-navigation.customization-modal.close-button-label",defaultMessage:"Cancel changes to your sidebar",description:"Accessibility label for the close button in the customization modal. Assistive te